			"notes": "# Emotecraft Fix Animate Texture v1.4.3-beta.5\n\nExperimental compatibility update for **Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric**.\n\n### Changes\n\n- Added a potential fix for outer skin layers not following body and limb bending during Emotecraft animations.\n- Improved BendyLib state copying by preparing missing destination bend mutator factories.\n- Preserved independent model geometry when copying bend states.\n- Maintained the missing-mutator crash protection introduced in beta.4.\n- Improved compatibility handling for Player Animator and BendyLib.\n- Improved cleanup of animation compatibility states when players leave.\n- Added automated regression tests for bend-state copying.\n\n### Compatibility\n\n- **Minecraft:** 1.21.1\n- **Mod Loader:** Fabric\n- **Java:** 21\n- **Requires:** Fabric API\n- Designed for use with Emotecraft, EMF, BendyLib, and player animation resource packs such as Fresh Animations: Player Extension.\n\n### Credits\n\n- **Catman0221** — Original mod creator and developer\n- **atleugim** — Fabric 1.21.11 port"
		},
