			"notes": "## Emotecraft Fix Animate Texture 1.4.3-beta.4\n\nExperimental compatibility update for Fabric 1.21.1.\n\n### Main changes\n\n- Fixes the reported Player Animator / BendyLib bending crash with EMF and FA Player.\n- Repairs missing `bend` mutators before Player Animator applies limb bending.\n- Preserves normal limb bending when the mutator can be restored.\n- Adds a null-safe fallback if a bend mutator remains unavailable or invalid.\n- Uses EMF's modern pause and vanilla-model condition APIs when available.\n- Prevents repeated EMF pause/lock operations while an emote is active."
		},
